  "details": "For example, say I have an avatar which has a Physbone applied to an Ear root bone with two child ear bones connected to it. If I set the Multi Child Type to ignore, the root bone is ignored in the physics. However, it is still counted as 3 bones in the Physbone Transform Count for performance. \n\nCurrently the only solution is to split it into two Physbone components, one for each ear bone, but that just has an even worse impact on performance.",
